+// (stdlib/FreeBSD/qsort.c and stdlib/FreeBSD/heapsort.c), so every host
+// orders equal elements the same way the macOS libc does. See also
+// licenses/LICENSE.apple-libc-qsort in xcross_gen_snapshot.
